h4. Safe mode

Safe mode hides every post not rated g (general). Turn it on or off in your settings; it applies only to your own account.

When safe mode hides posts on a page, the page says how many. A hidden post's page shows a notice instead of the image.

Safe mode is a filter you control. It is not the same as gated content, which is decided by the site and not by a setting -- see [[help:censored_tags]].
